{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065148/block/singleImage/3274893/df/01M82TN3903QXVE0GF6D6KKB9G.jpg?updatedAt=1795395012\"/><figcaption>荃灣大壩街爆鹹水管，水柱一度射上3層樓高。(有線新聞截圖)</figcaption></figure><p>荃灣有地底鹹水管爆裂。今日(23日)清晨5時，警方接獲有人報案，指荃灣大壩街23至24號對開位置有地底鹹水管爆裂。水柱一度噴出約3層樓高的水柱，並波及鄰近商店。警方到場封閉部分路段，其後水務署人員奉召到場處理並閂掣，並進行搶修。現場圖片顯示，爆鹹水管後，多塊路磚被沖散，路面遺下凹洞，附近散落碎石及沙泥。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T01:43:27.243639+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T00:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T02:28:32.803831+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T01:37:15.455908+00:00","content_hash":"32f1fbe4476651ee5b68b973b66c94c7a36308534e93cde57e66ce517585d8c7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}